/-!
# Actual step-zero source targets

Generated by `gen_s0a.py`. Shared additive interface for s0b. Source keys are
the actual online witness rows, not freshly chosen or assumed common keys.
Their cross-stage agreement with key preprocessing belongs to s0b.
Fresh and smudge values are coefficientwise; no digit, coefficient or member
family is expanded. This definition is an obligation, not its proof.

Interface correction, coordinated in s0a/REQUESTS.md: packed fresh plaintexts
have norm at most the ring dimension, not one. Each column adds n independently
placed signed monomials; the old Complete.Facts0.Step0.freshBound uses this bound.
-/

set_option maxRecDepth 16384
set_option Elab.async false

namespace Dio2Proof

